# Architecture

- Dependencies point apps → packages. Routes, pages, actions and feature UI stay in `apps/web`.
- A dependency used by two or more packages goes in the `catalog` of `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (`catalog:`).
- New package: `@repo/<name>`, `exports` to `src/*.ts`, add it to `transpilePackages` if the app imports it.

Guide: [docs/agents/architecture.md](docs/agents/architecture.md)
